    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/7efb36a3174bdec8927353ebfaf983c6.poster.avif?t=1744329684\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/7efb36a3174bdec8927353ebfaf983c6.webm?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/7efb36a3174bdec8927353ebfaf983c6.mp4?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face series of battles defending the good people against the force of evil. Fight together with the three heroes and together with various of fighters and spells combined. Together craft a strategy and action with various situations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single player gameplay with blend of action and strategy, with a point of view side scrolling defending game. Defeat the series of various enemies, each enemies bring different character and ways to defeat them. Fight against unique bosses through at the climax situation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/b00c8e18100eed02e5e768ba67803dc1.webp?t=1744329684\" width=360 height=30 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/70fb38c748d4897f05a647b4221295cd.poster.avif?t=1744329684\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/70fb38c748d4897f05a647b4221295cd.webm?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/70fb38c748d4897f05a647b4221295cd.mp4?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes possess abilities that players can choose to adapt to their play style and the battle's situation. Create synergy among all three available heroes, maximizing their combined potential. As the story progresses, heroes unlock new, collectible equipment. Players have direct control over the heroes, selecting and using their abilities, adding dynamic action to the gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/c5e8479d4a91c629b84bab4010033f56.webp?t=1744329684\" width=360 height=30 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/00098b9790c4dca1f2e6a31175ac89f6.poster.avif?t=1744329684\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/00098b9790c4dca1f2e6a31175ac89f6.webm?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/00098b9790c4dca1f2e6a31175ac89f6.mp4?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighters join the battle, standing alongside you in the fight. These brave individuals believe in heroic action, supporting from a distance and on the front lines. Strategically positioning these fighters and utilizing their unique classes creates a synergistic defense system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/61b73d3598fd1108793a2a3c41bd8abc.webp?t=1744329684\" width=360 height=30 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/ef9cd367344f65f72359e4818a79170b.poster.avif?t=1744329684\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/ef9cd367344f65f72359e4818a79170b.webm?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/ef9cd367344f65f72359e4818a79170b.mp4?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells that can turn the tide of battle are at the player\u2019s disposal. Each spell has unique characteristics, allowing players to select the most effective ones based on the situation. Whether buffing allies or destroying enemies, these spells play a crucial role in enhancing overall defense. The right combination of spells can create powerful synergies on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/47fdeada728f77d9fc6874aba336c1c3.webp?t=1744329684\" width=360 height=30 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/e3f96837605261fdec7eb390d6814525.poster.avif?t=1744329684\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/e3f96837605261fdec7eb390d6814525.webm?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/e3f96837605261fdec7eb390d6814525.mp4?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players immerse themselves in the story, becoming part of the Aeon World\u2014a fantasy realm where classic battles of good versus evil are waged, filled with magic and mystery. The story centers around the defense of Fort Burton, a legendary city that once withstood an immense evil power in ancient times. After a long period of peace, dark forces have risen again, invading from within and wreaking havoc on the people. Yet, heroes emerge to bring hope and stand against the dark power, fighting to protect the city and its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/5d2225ec78583d08c4f324d2f8130be5.webp?t=1744329684\" width=360 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is considered high-end gameplay, offering players the joy with content gradually added over time. This includes features like endless mode, additional storylines, unique gameplay experiences, and much more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/77e6e7f3af2e3f9966ecc40918411053.poster.avif?t=1744329684\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/77e6e7f3af2e3f9966ecc40918411053.webm?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/77e6e7f3af2e3f9966ecc40918411053.mp4?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/7efb36a3174bdec8927353ebfaf983c6.poster.avif?t=1744329684\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/7efb36a3174bdec8927353ebfaf983c6.webm?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/7efb36a3174bdec8927353ebfaf983c6.mp4?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face series of battles defending the good people against the force of evil. Fight together with the three heroes and together with various of fighters and spells combined. Together craft a strategy and action with various situations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single player gameplay with blend of action and strategy, with a point of view side scrolling defending game. Defeat the series of various enemies, each enemies bring different character and ways to defeat them. Fight against unique bosses through at the climax situation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/b00c8e18100eed02e5e768ba67803dc1.webp?t=1744329684\" width=360 height=30 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/70fb38c748d4897f05a647b4221295cd.poster.avif?t=1744329684\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/70fb38c748d4897f05a647b4221295cd.webm?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/70fb38c748d4897f05a647b4221295cd.mp4?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes possess abilities that players can choose to adapt to their play style and the battle's situation. Create synergy among all three available heroes, maximizing their combined potential. As the story progresses, heroes unlock new, collectible equipment. Players have direct control over the heroes, selecting and using their abilities, adding dynamic action to the gameplay.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/c5e8479d4a91c629b84bab4010033f56.webp?t=1744329684\" width=360 height=30 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/00098b9790c4dca1f2e6a31175ac89f6.poster.avif?t=1744329684\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/00098b9790c4dca1f2e6a31175ac89f6.webm?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/00098b9790c4dca1f2e6a31175ac89f6.mp4?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighters join the battle, standing alongside you in the fight. These brave individuals believe in heroic action, supporting from a distance and on the front lines. Strategically positioning these fighters and utilizing their unique classes creates a synergistic defense system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/61b73d3598fd1108793a2a3c41bd8abc.webp?t=1744329684\" width=360 height=30 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/ef9cd367344f65f72359e4818a79170b.poster.avif?t=1744329684\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/ef9cd367344f65f72359e4818a79170b.webm?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/ef9cd367344f65f72359e4818a79170b.mp4?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spells that can turn the tide of battle are at the player\u2019s disposal. Each spell has unique characteristics, allowing players to select the most effective ones based on the situation. Whether buffing allies or destroying enemies, these spells play a crucial role in enhancing overall defense. The right combination of spells can create powerful synergies on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/47fdeada728f77d9fc6874aba336c1c3.webp?t=1744329684\" width=360 height=30 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/e3f96837605261fdec7eb390d6814525.poster.avif?t=1744329684\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/e3f96837605261fdec7eb390d6814525.webm?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/e3f96837605261fdec7eb390d6814525.mp4?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players immerse themselves in the story, becoming part of the Aeon World\u2014a fantasy realm where classic battles of good versus evil are waged, filled with magic and mystery. The story centers around the defense of Fort Burton, a legendary city that once withstood an immense evil power in ancient times. After a long period of peace, dark forces have risen again, invading from within and wreaking havoc on the people. Yet, heroes emerge to bring hope and stand against the dark power, fighting to protect the city and its inhabitants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/5d2225ec78583d08c4f324d2f8130be5.webp?t=1744329684\" width=360 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is considered high-end gameplay, offering players the joy with content gradually added over time. This includes features like endless mode, additional storylines, unique gameplay experiences, and much more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/77e6e7f3af2e3f9966ecc40918411053.poster.avif?t=1744329684\" width=640 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/77e6e7f3af2e3f9966ecc40918411053.webm?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183790/extras/77e6e7f3af2e3f9966ecc40918411053.mp4?t=1744329684\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
